==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 30~45.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,360f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 21.33~25.33 seconds<sup>640f~760f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 32~34.67 seconds<sup>960f~1,040f</sup>.
**1 [[Pigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Ken is only at 1% magnification and the peons only 100%.

